{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（13日）晚上8時18分，警方及消防接獲多宗報案，指粉嶺坪輋路一個貨倉發生火警。初步顯示，至少兩人被消防員救出，火警中無人受傷。消防處指，火警於晚上9時58分大致被救熄，消防人員正進行降溫及散煙行動，如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請關閉門窗及保持鎮定。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.797958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:25:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:40.942083+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:55.545859+00:00","content_hash":"002bce3fee0e3df6513042be895d2cebdef82072bec37e96e45e224f2bba0c63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}